# The two counter-propagating waves see the same loop, so the result does not depend on wavelength: reflection 4 kappa (1 - kappa) = 1.00.

title Sagnac loop mirror, coupling 50%
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.5 1.6 201

comp c coupler kappa=0.5
comp w waveguide length=300
link c.3 w.1
link w.2 c.4
port in c.1
port out c.2

expect lossless
expect level in 1.55 0.00000000 1e-6
expect below out -200
